SUMMARY:SEMINAR SERIES: A tale of two metabolites - Creatine and Homoarginine in Heart Disease
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Craig Lygate (University of Glasgow)\nHost: Cecile Benezech\n\nTitle: "A tale of two metabolites: the therapeutic potential of creatine and homoarginine in heart disease"\n\nCreatine matches energy supply and demand in the heart. Homoarginine associated with poor outcomes in CVD.\n\nPizza social 13:00-13:30 at The Larder.\n\n⚠️ Pizza provided after at The Larder
